    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>purely</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>imaginary</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Then the sum of the elements is in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
